---
title: Writing
description: Notes on books, technology, theology, and whatever else has my attention.
---

<div class="post-list">
  {% for post in collections.publishedPosts %}
    <section class="post-list-item">
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="post-meta">{{ post.data.displayDate }}</p>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
